export anchor Calendar:
    description:
        The team calendar in week view, Monday 2 to Sunday 8 November 2026.

    controls:
        Previous week, Today and Next week buttons, a Day, Week or Month switch
        with Week selected, and a New event button.

    events:
        - Monday 2 Nov, 09:30 to 10:00, Weekly planning, whole team
        - Monday 2 Nov, all day, Hero image options due
        - Tuesday 3 Nov, 14:00 to 15:00, Billing migration review, Jonas Weber and Sam Ortiz
        - Wednesday 4 Nov, 11:00 to 12:30, Survey readout, Aiko Tanaka
        - Thursday 5 Nov, 10:00 to 10:30, Design critique, Priya Nair
        - Thursday 5 Nov, 16:00 to 17:00, Mobile release go or no-go, Sam Ortiz
        - Friday 6 Nov, 15:00 to 16:00, Team retro
        - Saturday 7 Nov, all day, Q4 customer survey due

    sidePanel:
        A small month grid for November with today, 2 November, marked, and a
        list of calendars to show, Team, Deadlines and Out of office. Lena
        Fischer is out of office on Friday 6 November.
